        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-9009P/415, Modern Infinity Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe kitchen often becomes the center of gatherings so it's important that the refrigerator looks as good as the rest of the room. The Infinity Appliance Pull has a sleek look enhanced by an interesting shape for an eye-catching combination that adds a modern twist to contemporary homes. At 18\" long it is hefty enough to last on even the most used appliances. With a 2-5/8\" projection, it has plenty of clearance for you to get a good grip on heavier doors. It is constructed out of solid brass and is available in satin nickel, polished chrome, and oil-rubbed bronze finishes. And, as you might have guessed, this pull is great for so much more than the refrigerator. Use it all over your home for a cohesive look.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: <a href=\"/products/infinity-cabinet-pull-omnia-9009\"><b>Matching Infinity Cabinet Handles</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia AP-9009P/415 Infinity Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 16-5/16\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Thickness: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
